  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Sam. I am eight. This is my mother. She is a woman. She is a teacher. She has a nice smile.",
      "This is my father. He is a man. He has a big body. He has two big arms. I have a small body. I have two small arms. Look at us!",
      "We are a family. How many people? We are three. Mother, Father, and I. Do you have a mother? Do you have a father? I love my family."
    ],
